  dialogueLines:
  - Caw! Caw caw! ca- *cough cough*
  - Apologies. It has been awhile since I have spoken to a human.
  - You have traveled through the villages of my kingdom, and now you find yourself
    in my castle.
  - ..yes this used to be a castle, I know....
  - You have seen the state of the villages, yes?
  - ...is what I would normally say. But you..
  - You decided to get here the quick and dirty way.
  - WHO TOLD YOU THE COMMAND?!?!
  - WHY WOULD YOU TYPE 'WIN' IN IT?!?!
  - Nevermind that it is listed when you type 'help'!
  - Help is for the developers only!!
  - This is a puzzle game! Figure it all out!!
  - Anyway, now that you HAVEN'T played our game...
  - You need to pay.
  - Good luck getting out of this one, pal.
